$''
$'  I\'m Pedro Veríssimo, a builder from São Gabriel, a town of about'
$'  60,000 people in the far south of Brazil. When something grabs my'
$'  attention, I go all the way, until there\'s something I can point to.'
$''
$'  \e[2mfrom  \e[0m  São Gabriel, RS, fifth generation of rice and cattle farmers'
$'  \e[2mroute \e[0m  São Gabriel → Porto Alegre (2024) → São Paulo (2026) → ???'
$'  \e[2mnow   \e[0m  tech co-founder of Sincra · Link School of Business'
$'  \e[2mspeaks\e[0m  Portuguese, English (C2, self-taught by 16), Spanish'
$''
$'  In 2024 I moved to Porto Alegre on my own, in the middle of a school'
$'  year, because that was the only window I had. Most of what\'s on these'
$'  pages happened after that move.'
$''
$'@a4 t'
$'  \e[2mWhat I am building now.\e[0m'
$''
