$''
$'  \e[1m"Doctors shouldn\'t pay interest on money that\'s already theirs."\e[0m'
$''
$'  In Brazil a surgeon can wait months to be paid for an operation, and'
$'  the hospital often can\'t tell where that money is stuck: internal'
$'  audit, the insurer, a missing signature. Sincra rebuilds every'
$'  procedure\'s path from surgery to payout and predicts how much each'
$'  doctor will receive, when, and with what confidence.'
$''
$'  \e[38;2;79;127;255m01 connect\e[0m\e[2m  →  \e[0m\e[38;2;79;127;255m02 rebuild\e[0m\e[2m  →  \e[0m\e[38;2;79;127;255m03 predict\e[0m\e[2m  →  \e[0m\e[38;2;79;127;255m04 show\e[0m\e[2m  →  \e[0m\e[38;2;79;127;255m05 advance\e[0m'
$''
$'  \e[2mrole   \e[0m  tech co-founder, one of three: product and engineering'
$'  \e[2mhistory\e[0m  started as shift scheduling; changed thesis at Link\'s Startup'
$'           School'
$'  \e[2mweb    \e[0m  https://sincra.app'
$''
