$'  \e[38;2;46;230;166m\e[1m716,000+\e[0m\e[0m\e[2m participants   \e[0m\e[38;2;46;230;166m\e[1m28\e[0m\e[0m\e[2m golds   \e[0m\e[38;2;46;230;166m\e[1m1\e[0m\e[0m\e[2m of them mine\e[0m'
$''
$'  The rounds went from theory and ethics, to building models in Python,'
$'  to a final where I built a computer-vision algorithm for competing'
$'  robots, trained on Santos Dumont II, Brazil\'s national supercomputer.'
$''
