$''
$'  At InovaTec, my school\'s student innovation club, I found lots of'
$'  ambition and almost no one who could build. As head of technology I'
$'  rebuilt the platform from scratch, and a team of four launched it in'
$'  about four months.'
$''
$'  \e[38;2;255;212;59m\e[1m170+\e[0m\e[0m\e[2m volunteers   \e[0m\e[38;2;255;212;59m\e[1m20\e[0m\e[0m\e[2m NGOs   \e[0m\e[38;2;255;212;59m\e[1m80+\e[0m\e[0m\e[2m blood donors   \e[0m\e[38;2;255;212;59m\e[1mR$6,300\e[0m\e[0m\e[2m Braille printer\e[0m'
$''
$'  Covered by RBS TV, SBT, Zero Hora, Brasil de Fato and Correio do Povo.'
$'  In July 2026 the students I trained used it to help fund an art school'
$'  in Morro da Cruz.'
$''
