$''
$'  My feed kept serving the same repeatable formats with millions of'
$'  views, so I tried to reverse-engineer them. The first two pages went'
$'  nowhere. Then a crab took off.'
$''
$'  \e[38;2;255;79;139m@seusiriqueijo\e[0m  183K  the most famous crab in Brazil'
$'  \e[38;2;255;79;139m@gatinhoajude \e[0m   83K  a cat drinking water; one reel: 340,088 accounts'
$'  \e[38;2;255;79;139m@inteligenciai\e[0m   50K  about AI'
$''
$'  7.2 million accounts reached in one 30-day window. My benchmark: the'
$'  two biggest accounts that started copying me. I couldn\'t monetize, so'
$'  I sold all three, for R$1,200, R$800 and R$160. Lesson: sell before'
$'  you build.'
$''
